Hi,

it seems there are virtual environments not correctly implementing the MSR
(e.g. VirtualBox bug: https://www.virtualbox.org/ticket/14099) or not imple=
menting
it at all (e.g. KVM). PowerTOP just exits in such environments and cannot r=
un.
 =

The proposed patch makes PowerTOP not to exit on MSR read errors, but still
report them.

Resending as attachment, because the previous e-mail has been probably bloc=
ked
somewhere

thanks & regards

Jaroslav

